<https://cnw-ld.org/work/CNW1/expression/1> a frbr:Expression ;
    frbr:realizationOf <https://cnw-ld.org/work/CNW1> ;
    cnw:hasNotatedIncipit false ;
    cnw:hasNotatedMusic false ;
    cnw:incipitImage "cnw_001_1_1.png" ;
    cnw:incipitText "Abner! Svar, er det dig?"@da,
        "Er Slaget forbi?"@da,
        "Frydesang, Paukeklang"@da,
        "Glæde over Mandens Arm"@da,
        "Herre, tag Skjold og Værge"@da,
        "Herren er Vidne, Pagten er sluttet paany"@da,
        "Hvem banker?"@da,
        "Hvem bragte dig hid?"@da,
        "Hvem kalder? Hvem der?"@da,
        "Ja! Han er død!"@da,
        "Jeg har set dig en Gang"@da,
        "Jeg kommer fra Bethlehems Dale"@da,
        "Kommer han? Kommer Profeten?"@da,
        "Kong Saul, min Fader!"@da,
        "Kongen er syg!"@da,
        "Kunde jeg rejse mig mod dig"@da,
        "Saa I ham, Piger?"@da,
        "Samuel! Samuel! Hjælp mig at dø!"@da,
        "Saul! Hvi løfter du Sveddugen bort fra min Pande"@da,
        "Se natten Mikal; et tindrende Dyb!"@da,
        "Sejr for Israel ved Davids Haand!"@da,
        "Ser du - ? hans Vognborg"@da,
        "Svende giv Agt, giv Agt!"@da,
        "Abner! Say, is that you?"@en,
        "God be our shield and fortress"@en,
        "God is our witnessm vows have been plighted again"@en,
        "How goes it now?"@en,
        "I come out of Bethlehem's vallys"@en,
        "I saw you one day"@en,
        "I would rebel against Thy word"@en,
        "Is he come? See ye the Prophet?"@en,
        "King Saul, my father"@en,
        "Look there, Saul's stronghold!"@en,
        "Look upward, Michal; how deep is the night!"@en,
        "Maidens, you saw him"@en,
        "Praise the strength that men possess"@en,
        "Samuel! Samuel! help me to die"@en,
        "Saul is not well"@en,
        "Saul, why have you drawn the sweatcloth away from my forehead"@en,
        "Saved is Israel by David's hand!"@en,
        "Shout for joy, sound the drums"@en,
        "Warriors, there, look there!"@en,
        "Who brought you to me?"@en,
        "Who knocks there?"@en,
        "Who's calling? Who's there?"@en,
        "Yes, he is dead!"@en ;
    cnw:meter "3/4" ;
    cnw:performingForce "A.",
        "B.",
        "B.Bar.",
        "S.",
        "T.",
        "arpa",
        "camp.",
        "cb.",
