        "Shadows hover, sad and mournful"@en,
        "Spread out thy pinions, on their strength relying"@en,
        "Still rests the morning twilight"@en,
        "Thanks, ye kindly sisters"@en,
        "The birds, in playful throng"@en,
        "There comes with waving dusky robes bedight"@en,
